lines+=['','All selected outcomes passed the native replay audit. Original sources and independently compiled Wasm hashes were checked. Full exports were byte-verified; lossless replay exports were checked against the original private action-log hashes and chains, native audited outcomes, and preserved public-observation hashes. The replay decoder reproduced all original public/private hashes in a 36-game qualification.','', 'One Gemini authoring attempt failed on an API response and was replaced by a fresh full attempt. Grading-only recoveries reused frozen source and available audited checkpoints, with no additional authoring or LLM calls. The first complete validated grading export was selected for each source; selection never used its reward. Raw infrastructure failures and recovery provenance remain in the result manifest.','',f"Recorded successful completed-response OpenRouter charges: **${report['costs']['completed_call_openrouter_usd']:.2f}**. The failed authoring attempt recorded ${failed_cost:.2f}. These exclude potentially billed interrupted calls and setup probes. Proxy subscription and settled Daytona dollars are unavailable, not measured zero.",'', 'Local ARM and cloud x86_64 execution used the same declared limits; hardware and concurrent endpoint latency remain practical comparability limits. The displayed SD covers five authored bots on this fixed panel.','', '[Complete compact results and provenance](results.json). Final Rust sources are under `sources/`, and immutable validation receipts are under `validation_receipts/`. Large native conversations, replay datasets, private reference assets and container images remain under the campaign artifact paths and are not backed up by this Git snapshot.']
(output/'README.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
